---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Announcements
eyebrow: Squadron news
intro: Monthly updates from 395 Squadron – training schedules, Commanding Officer’s updates, administration notices and news from the parents’ committee.
description: Weekly and monthly announcements from 395 Edmonton Royal Canadian Air Cadet Squadron.
permalink: /announcements/
---
{%- set latest = collections.posts[0] %}
<div class="subscribe-bar">
  <p>Never miss an update:</p>
  <a class="chip" href="/announcements/feed.xml">{% icon "rss" %} RSS feed</a>
  <a class="chip" href="/calendar/#subscribe">{% icon "calendar" %} Subscribe to the calendar</a>
  <a class="chip" href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" rel="noopener">{% icon "facebook" %} Facebook</a>
  <a class="chip" href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" rel="noopener">{% icon "instagram" %} Instagram</a>
</div>

{%- if latest %}
<article class="feature-post card">
  <div class="feature-post-body">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--gold">Latest announcement</p>
    <h2><a href="{{ latest.url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="post-meta">Posted <time datetime="{{ latest.date | isoDate }}">{{ latest.date | date("long") }}</time>{% if latest.data.author %} · {{ latest.data.author }}{% endif %}</p>
    <p>{{ latest | postSummary(320) }}</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ latest.url }}">Read the {{ latest.data.title }} announcement {% icon "arrow-right", "icon-sm" %}</a>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-post-aside">
    <h3>Coming up</h3>
    {% set list = calendar.events | upcoming %}{% set upcomingMax = 5 %}
    {% include "partials/upcoming-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</article>
{%- endif %}

<h2 class="section-title">Earlier announcements</h2>
<div class="post-archive">
{%- for post in collections.posts %}
  {%- if not loop.first %}
  <article class="archive-card card">
    <p class="archive-date"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | date("long") }}</time></p>
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p>{{ post | postSummary(150) }}</p>
  </article>
  {%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</div>
